#
# Standard CRC-32 (ISO 3309) checksum implementation using a 256-entry lookup
# table precomputed from the polynomial 0xEDB88320 (bit-reversed 0x04C11DB7).
# Used by Kafka legacy record format (magic 0/1) and gzip/zlib checksums.
